  m_Name: New QR Code Data 22
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "\u0130kaz Lambas\u0131 (Durum G\xF6stergesi)"
  title: "\u0130kaz Lambas\u0131 (Durum G\xF6stergesi)"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "\u0130kaz lambas\u0131, test arac\u0131n\u0131n \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma
    ve g\xFCvenlik durumunu g\xF6rsel olarak g\xF6stermek amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r.
    Farkl\u0131 renklerde yanan \u0131\u015F\u0131klar, sistemin enerjili olup olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131,
    testin aktif durumda bulunup bulunmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 veya koruma devrelerinin
    devrede olup olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 hakk\u0131nda operat\xF6re anl\u0131k bilgi
    verir. B\xF6ylece saha personeli, cihaz\u0131n \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma durumunu
    uzaktan ve h\u0131zl\u0131 bir \u015Fekilde kontrol edebilir."
